## 2. lockfile

command: pnpm install --lockfile-only   (exit 0)
    Scope: all 2 workspace projects
    Lockfile is up to date, resolution step is skipped
command: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile   (exit 0)
    97 packages reused/added for the root devDependencies

pnpm-lock.yaml sha256 from P0-04 through this follow-up:
    1d0e75f75debff3cf9eb8a3891d6e26ffe5e81b77a4e28002439400bf67f45a9

The lockfile stays unchanged on purpose: the new workspace package declares no dependencies (no new
dependency allowed), and pnpm 12 writes no importer entry for a package without dependencies. The
frozen install on the workspace graph succeeds, so the lockfile is in sync and nothing is committed.

