## 8. Acceptance map

A1: tokens.json + tests/tokens.test.mjs - groups colours, spacing, sizes, radii, typography, motion,
    shadows, layers; names from docs/design-rules.md, values from blueprint 21.1 first and
    reference/src/app/globals.css where the blueprint summary has none. Borders, the focus outline
    and the tooltip radius are included as tokens (design rules 3, 6 and 13). tokens.json holds
    token values only; its four open points moved to README.md ("Open questions"), and the tooltip
    radius point is resolved by the new --radius-tooltip token. 37/37 tests pass.
A2: codegen.mjs - deterministic (stable order, LF, no timestamps); tokens.css, tokens.h and layers.ts
    are committed and equal the in-memory render; two runs leave the package tree clean (section 3)
    and the tokens-codegen gate passes.
A3: icons/ - exactly the ten toolbar SVGs (note, source, image, file, zone, checklist, palette,
    columns, timeline, table), each viewBox 0 0 24 24, fill="none", stroke="currentColor",
    stroke-width 1.6, round caps/joins, geometry copied from the reference component.
A4: board-check (before install, node_modules removed), tokens-codegen, unit, lint and typecheck all
    exit 0; exactly one record per gate is committed with the single P0-12 commit.

## 9. Open questions

They are documented in packages/ui-kit/README.md ("Open questions"), not in tokens.json:
- font families (reference stacks lead with framework font variables; the tokens keep the explicit
  fallback families and leave loading the real families/licences to the web-app task);
- reference-only colour tokens (--accent-strong, --on-light, --button, --button-hover), not named by
  the design law and deliberately not tokens;
- layer 7a (no integer z-index between 7 and 8; layers.ts records order "7a" with z-index 7);
- tooltip radius: resolved in this follow-up by the token --radius-tooltip (6px).
